<title>CHINA: Sum Cheong changes name to China Dev Corp.</title>
<headline>Sum Cheong changes name to China Dev Corp.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sum Cheong International Ltd said it had changed its name to China Development Corporation Ltd with effect from Friday.</p>
<p>The company said its shareholders had at an extraordinary general meeting on June 24 approved the proposed change of the company name.</p>
<p>The company is engaged in trading, construction, mining and manufacturing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
